<title>USA: Pathogenesis files New Drug Application.</title>
<headline>Pathogenesis files New Drug Application.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PathoGenesis Corp said Thursday it filed a New Drug Application (NDA) for its lead product TOBI(TM) (tobramycin for inhalation) to treat chronic lung infections in people with cystic fibrosis.</p>
<p>The FDA has granted TOBI an expedited review.</p>
<p>TOBI is a proprietary formulation of the antibiotic tobramycin for delivery by inhalation using a nebulizer.</p>
